      "content": "Wait, really? I thought we had a pretty unique approach with how we stack the layers. Is 10,555,889 actually going to be a problem for the filing? \n\nI don't want to spook the investors if we can navigate this. If we stay quiet about it for now and just focus on our specific efficiency metrics, do you think we can still push through the application without it being an issue? In other words, how much of a dealbreaker is this actually?",
